        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is like gambling. Players are always in a situation of success and loss. As I said before, there is no save file in the whole process. If it is broken, you need to start from the beginning, and everything will become the most original. It pays tribute to &quot;I am Egg&quot; Capsule Hero is a third-person physics challenge game that focuses on balance and operating skills. You will play a capsule-shaped character, slowly moving forward, jumping, and maintaining balance on an extremely narrow wooden structure. There is no convenient way, only gravity, inertia, failure, and trying again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⸻</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Simple operation, deep challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All operations can be completed using the WASD keys on the keyboard, but it is not easy to control. You must always adjust the character's posture to avoid falling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Real physics system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses a real physics engine to simulate the character's movement and balance state. Every action may change your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• No archive, no fault tolerance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure means starting over. The game has no automatic save and no checkpoint system. Every success is the result of persistence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Immersive experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex UI, no disruptive prompts, focus on the challenge itself, let you immerse yourself in every walk and failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is like gambling. Players are always in a situation of success and loss. As I said before, there is no save file in the whole process. If it is broken, you need to start from the beginning, and everything will become the most original. It pays tribute to &quot;I am Egg&quot; Capsule Hero is a third-person physics challenge game that focuses on balance and operating skills. You will play a capsule-shaped character, slowly moving forward, jumping, and maintaining balance on an extremely narrow wooden structure. There is no convenient way, only gravity, inertia, failure, and trying again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⸻</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Simple operation, deep challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All operations can be completed using the WASD keys on the keyboard, but it is not easy to control. You must always adjust the character's posture to avoid falling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Real physics system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses a real physics engine to simulate the character's movement and balance state. Every action may change your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• No archive, no fault tolerance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure means starting over. The game has no automatic save and no checkpoint system. Every success is the result of persistence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Immersive experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex UI, no disruptive prompts, focus on the challenge itself, let you immerse yourself in every walk and failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
